  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In VRChat 2026.3.1 `Build 1878` and later, it's no longer possible to see from \"All Friends\" how long a friend has been offline without opening their profile. This used to exist in VRChat 2026.2.3p3 `Build 1867` with the old UI.\n\nThis is an UI regression for users who want to unfriend those who have been offline for very long periods of time. Now an user needs to open each profile individually to see the offline time from their full profile, which is cumbersome for users with lots of friends.\n\nPlease consider adding offline time back to the \"All Friends\" view for offline friends.\n\nScreenshots provided from VRChat 2026.2.3p3 `Build 1867` and VRChat 2026.3.2 (OPEN BETA) `Build 1896` for comparison.\n\nAdditional info: Feedback originally submitted to reddit by ThisIsNotTex: https://www.reddit.com/r/VRchat/comments/1vrxmu9/comment/p4h4c6u/",
